      "title": "Time Technoplast Limited (NSEI:TIMETECHNO) entered into a Memorandum of Understanding to acquire 76% stake in Systoverse Private Limited.",
      "body": "Time Technoplast Limited (NSEI:TIMETECHNO) entered into a Memorandum of Understanding to acquire 76% stake in Systoverse Private Limited from the promoters of Systoverse on April 14, 2026. A cash consideration will be paid by Time Technoplast Limited. The remaining 24% stake of Systoverse to be retained by existing shareholders.\r\n\r\nThe transaction is subject to customary due diligence, including financial, legal, tax, and regulatory assessment. The transaction is expected to complete within 60 days.",
